

Programu usimamizi-wa-kumbukumbu: 4.

>> i := 0.
Towe andika: ['Can we count to 10 using a whileTrue loop ?'], mstari-mpya.
{ Towe andika: i, mstari-mpya. } wakati-wa: { i ongeza: 1. <- (i ≤ 10). }.
Towe andika: ['Can we count back from 10 to 0 using a whileFalse loop ?'], mstari-mpya.
{ Towe andika: i, mstari-mpya. } wakati-wa: { i toa: 1. <- (i ≥ 0). }.
